{"id":"n59230-2-7","stage":1,"title":"나머지 · 剩下的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59230-2-7-1","ko":"오늘 수업 시간에 못 푼 나머지 문제는 숙제로 해 오세요.","zh":"今天上课时没解出来的剩下的题目，请作为作业带过来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"수업","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}},{"text":"시간에","meaning":"时间","explanation":"시간：时间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"2","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간에","audio":"/audio/6e584c2e1ef26484da55.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"푼","meaning":"解开，解答","explanation":"풀다：解开，解答；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"풀다","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29761","senseId":"5","lemma":"풀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"푼","audio":"/audio/c36a6882191214bf6a31.mp3"}},{"text":"나머지","meaning":"剩下的，其余的","explanation":"나머지：剩下的，其余的。","readings":[{"term":"나머지","audio":"/audio/b670444e5c04d73617d3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59230","senseId":"2","lemma":"나머지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나머지","audio":"/audio/b670444e5c04d73617d3.mp3"}},{"text":"문제는","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제는","audio":"/audio/be63aa4f8e571c21ded3.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제로","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙제로","audio":"/audio/c1d37dbee97d28fbee71.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"오세요.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오세요","audio":"/audio/711a38a6d901435cf889.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"为了做某事而定下的时刻；或指一天中的某个时刻。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"cada9014a11f228c","term":"풀다","zh":"解开，解答","audio":"/audio/cada9014a11f228c9dfe.mp3","entryId":"29761","definition":"解决不懂、复杂的问题或找到其答案。","pronunciation":["풀다"]},{"id":"b670444e5c04d736","term":"나머지","zh":"剩下的，其余的","audio":"/audio/b670444e5c04d73617d3.mp3","entryId":"59230","definition":"做某事时还未做完的部分。","pronunciation":["나머지"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"b33db886cc66d392","term":"숙제","zh":"作业","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3","entryId":"65226","definition":"为了复习或预习，给学生布置的课后功课。","pronunciation":["숙쩨"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/15ed1f5f63e389c6e7d9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59230-2-7-2","ko":"선생님, 그러면 숙제가 너무 많아요.","zh":"老师，那样的话作业就太多了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님,","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"그러면","meaning":"那么，那样的话","explanation":"그러면：那么，那样的话。","readings":[{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58276","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제가","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sourc